WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.340
Every hiring tool hands you a number. Almost none of them show their work.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:09.210
Trajectory turns a messy brief into requirements you can actually edit.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:14.210
Every match cites its evidence, and tells you exactly why it isn't a hundred.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.550
Say what's wrong in plain English. Review the change. Watch the ranking move.

00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.170
Trajectory. Hire for where they're going.
